) Dunal',23,2,'A small shrub native to India, used in traditional medicine for its adaptogenic and anti-inflammatory properties.'),('TREE0012','Caesalpinia sappan L.',6,3,'A small tree native to tropical regions, used in traditional medicine for its antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties.'),('TREE0016','Chloroxylon swietenia DC.',10,3,'A small tree native to tropical regions, used in traditional medicine for its anti-inflammatory and antimicrobial properties.'),('TREE0024','Citrus aurantifolia (Christm.) Swingle',10,3,'A small citrus tree native to Southeast Asia, valued for its aromatic fruit and use in traditional medicine for digestive and respiratory issues.'),('TREE0025','Citrus aurantium L.',10,3,'A citrus tree native to the Mediterranean region, known for its tangy fruit and use in traditional medicine for digestive and anti-inflammatory properties.'),('TREE0026','Citrus grandis (L.) Osbeck.',10,3,'A large citrus tree native to Asia, known for its large, sweet fruit and use in traditional medicine for its digestive and anti-inflammatory benefits.'),('TREE0027','Citrus medica L.',10,3,'A citrus tree native to the Mediterranean region, valued for its medicinal peel and use in traditional medicine for its digestive and anti-inflammatory effects.'),('TREE0028','Citrus sinensis (L.) Osbeck.',10,3,'A common citrus tree native to Asia, used in traditional medicine for its digestive and antioxidant properties.'),('TREE0042','Coffea canephora Pierre ex A.Froehner',18,3,'A small shrub native to tropical Africa, valued for its medicinal seeds used to treat digestive and respiratory issues.'),('TREE0043','Coffea liberica Bull.',18,3,'A small shrub native to tropical Africa, known for its medicinal seeds used to treat digestive and respiratory issues.'),('TREE0045','Cordia obliqua Willd.',20,3,'A small tree native to tropical regions, known for its edible fruit and use in traditional medicine for digestive and skin conditions.'),('TREE0046','Cordia myxa L.',20,3,'A 